    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Array.reduce()",
    "descriptionContent": "Impara a ridurre i valori di un array in un unico valore",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17477,
        "title": "Riduci",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148361,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A volte dobbiamo convertire una serie di valori di un array in un singolo valore. Ad esempio, quando vogliamo calcolare un punteggio finale.</p><p>Un modo classico per farlo consiste nell'usare un ciclo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" score += element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuttavia, JavaScript offre un metodo più semplice già esistente. <code>.reduce()</code> può combinare i valori di un Array in un unico valore usando una funzione inline.</p><p><code>.reduce()</code> usa la sintassi: <code>ArrayName.reduce()</code>. Vediamo come potremmo chiamarlo sull'array <code>points</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>points</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>reduce</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per indicare alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori, dobbiamo prima passare una funzione come parametro.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La nostra funzione ha bisogno di due parametri: il primo per accedere al risultato della <strong>riduzione</strong> precedente e il secondo per accedere al valore corrente.</p><p>Aggiungi due parametri: <code>prev</code> e <code>curr</code>, in quest'ordine.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>prev,</code>, seguito da <code>curr</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>reduce()</code> itera su un array e, a ogni valore, esegue un'operazione con i due parametri finché arriva a un singolo valore.</p><p>Ad esempio, per calcolare il punteggio totale, la funzione inline restituisce la somma della riduzione <code>prev</code> e del valore <code>curr</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>return</code>, seguito da <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per semplificare la sintassi, possiamo usare una funzione freccia JavaScript al posto della funzione inline.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = [\" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = points.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>(prevVal, currVal)</code>, seguito da <code>=&gt;</code> e infine <code>prevVal + currVal</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se includiamo un terzo parametro nella funzione, possiamo anche accedere all'indice di ogni iterazione.</p><p>In questo esempio, usiamo <code>.reduce()</code> per sommare i valori di <code>damage</code>, ma incorporiamo anche <code>index</code> per applicare un moltiplicatore della combo da un secondo array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"214\" endIndex=\"219\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboMultiplier = [\" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0.9\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalDamage = damage.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + (currVal * comboMultiplier[index]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>index</code>, seguito da <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148368,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale funzione JavaScript possiamo usare per convertire una serie di valori di un array in un unico valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.reduce()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.filter()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.reduce()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa dobbiamo passare come parametro per dire alla funzione <code>.reduce()</code> come combinare i valori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una variabile</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una funzione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa dà accesso il primo parametro della funzione inline a <code>reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148371,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa dà accesso il secondo parametro della funzione inline a <code>reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il risultato della riduzione precedente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il valore dell'array dell'iterazione corrente.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148372,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A cosa possiamo accedere aggiungendo un terzo parametro facoltativo alla funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'array chiamato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere L'indice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiama la funzione <code>.reduce()</code> sull'array <code>damage</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalDamage = damage.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>damage</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>reduce</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una funzione inline all'interno della funzione <code>.reduce()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" drops = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalLoot = drops.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>function</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi i parametri appropriati per consentire alla funzione inline di accedere al valore della riduzione precedente e al valore corrente dell'array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" drops = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalLoot = drops.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev * curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalLoot);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>prev</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vogliamo che la funzione <code>.reduce()</code> concateni tutti i <code>parts</code> in un nome di livello.</p><p>Scrivi la parola chiave corretta nella funzione inline in modo che restituisca il valore della riduzione precedente concatenato con la parte corrente.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Room&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = parts.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prev + \" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + curr;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la funzione freccia in modo che <code>totalDamage</code> contenga la somma dei valori dell'array <code>damage</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"121\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage = [\" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalDamage = damage.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>+ currVal</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
